"temp": "115",
"pelletType": "None",
"probeTarget": "",
"doneness": "Toasted"
},
"notes": "Store your finished cannabutter in an airtight jar in the refrigerator for up to a month, or in the freezer for up to 6 months. When using this butter in recipes, remember that potency varies based on the strength of your starting flower. Always test a small amount first to gauge its effects.",
